cff-version: 1.2.0
message: |
  If you use NeuroFlow in academic work, please cite both the
  software and the Stage 1 MVP paper. The DOI below is the
  software DOI (assigned by Zenodo on first tagged release);
  the paper DOI is the arXiv ID once uploaded.
title: "NeuroFlow"
abstract: |
  NeuroFlow is an industrial-grade neural operator framework for
  PDE-centric scientific computing. It pairs a PyTorch research
  layer with a zero-dependency C++ runtime and an optional
  pybind11 binding, exposed through a versioned intermediate
  representation (NeuroIR) so trained operators can be deployed
  inside HPC/CFD pipelines.
